msgstr "Parcel type"

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_delivery_carrier__dhlparcel_parcel_type
msgid ""
"Het type van élk pakket dat met deze verzendmethode verzonden wordt. Maak "
"één verzendmethode per parceltype dat je aanbiedt. Kies 'Gemengd' om "
"verschillende types in één zending te kunnen combineren — op de delivery "
"verschijnt dan een DHL Parcels-tab waar je per parcel een type kiest "
"(zoals in het MyDHLParcel-portal)."
msgstr ""
"The type of every parcel sent through this shipping method. Create one "
"shipping method per parcel type you offer. Pick 'Mixed' to combine different "
"types in a single shipment — a DHL Parcels tab then appears on the delivery "
"where you set the type per parcel (like in the MyDHLParcel portal)."

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_delivery_carrier__dhlparcel_default_weight
msgid "Default weight (kg)"
msgstr "Default weight (kg)"

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_delivery_carrier__dhlparcel_default_weight
msgid ""
"Used when a parcel's weight is 0 (e.g. products without a weight set). DHL "
"refuses a 0 kg shipment, so this value is sent instead."
msgstr ""
"Used when a parcel's weight is 0 (e.g. products without a weight set). DHL "
"refuses a 0 kg shipment, so this value is sent instead."

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_stock_picking__dhl_parcel_count
msgid "Aantal pakketten"
msgstr "Number of parcels"

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_stock_picking__dhl_parcel_count
msgid ""
"Aantal identieke pakketten in deze zending (multicollo). Genegeerd zodra je "
"Put in Pack gebruikt: dan bepalen de aangemaakte packages het aantal pieces."
msgstr ""
"Number of identical parcels in this shipment (multicollo). Ignored once you "
"use Put in Pack: in that case the created packages drive the piece count."

#. module: delivery_dhl_parcel
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:delivery_dhl_parcel.field_stock_picking__dhl_parcel_line_ids
